  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>About: Reads the Unmatched NETC xlsx, runs a rule-based AI root-cause engine and routes each exception:&#xd;&#xa; - Auto-Reversal track: MULTI_ANTENNA_DOUBLE_DEBIT under INR 1,000 -&gt; instant FASTag wallet refund instruction (AUTO_APPROVED,&#xd;&#xa;   refundSlaDeadline = now + 5 min) POSTed to NPCI_URL.&#xd;&#xa; - HITL track: BLACKLISTED_TAG_PASSAGE / LOW_BALANCE_OVERDRAFT, or CONCESSIONAIRE_FEE_DISPUTE above INR 5,000 -&gt; evidence package&#xd;&#xa;   (EPC reader log, plaza CCTV reference, wallet / GL snapshot, SHA-256 hash) POSTed as PENDING_APPROVAL to NPCI_QUEUE_URL.&#xd;&#xa; - Everything else is PARKED_OPS_REVIEW and recorded in NETC_Dispatch_Plan_&lt;timestamp&gt;.xlsx.&#xd;&#xa;Thresholds: AUTO_REFUND_LIMIT, HITL_THRESHOLD, REFUND_SLA_MINUTES (config).&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Runtime params: UnMatched_File_Path, NPCI_URL, NPCI_QUEUE_URL. Success: &#x22;NETC AI Root-Cause Completed - Dual-Track Enqueued&#x22;.&#xd;&#xa;Errors: inputs validated; connection failures go down the REST error hop and into the audit; any failed dispatch = Failure.</note>
      <xloc>64</xloc>
      <yloc>680</yloc>
      <width>900</width>
      <heigth>300</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>11</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>0</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>0</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>0</fontcolorblue>
      <backgroundcolorred>192</backgroundcolorred>
      <backgroundcolorgreen>192</backgroundcolorgreen>
      <backgroundcolorblue>192</backgroundcolorblue>
      <bordercolorred>100</bordercolorred>
      <bordercolorgreen>100</bordercolorgreen>
      <bordercolorblue>100</bordercolorblue>
      <drawshadow>Y</drawshadow>
      <shadow_size>5</shadow_size>
    </notepad>
  </notepads>
</transformation>
